.SH "نام (NAME)"
cxl \- Provides enumeration and provisioning commands for CXL platforms
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
.nf
\fIcxl\fP [\-\-version] [\-\-help] COMMAND [ARGS]
.fi
.br
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\-v, \-\-version
.RS 4
Display the version of the \fIcxl\fP utility.
.RE
.sp
\-h, \-\-help
.RS 4
Run the \fIcxl help\fP command.
.RE
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
The cxl utility provides enumeration and provisioning commands for
the CXL devices managed by the Linux kernel.
